# Clean an index file. Currently, this works on tohtmlindexentry, but
# in principle could be applied to the latex indexentry.
#
# Clean in this case means:
# 1. Remove arguments in function definitions
# 2. Add index names as required
#
# There are several indices:
#   TERM - General index
#   CONST - MPI Constants and predefined handles
#   EXAMPLES - Examples
#   NEWEXAMPLES - Examples with a special format; see below
#   TYPEDEF - MPI C typedefs
#   <null> - MPI Functions

